  "Unyielding": "",
  "Deal Elec damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, distribute this damage between all foes. Inflict targets with <link\\=\"s|104\"><u>Shock</u></link> and [Flashover] for $2 turns. Motoha gains [Light].\\n[Flashover]: Increase DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>A single strike bids farewell to the naivety of the past, like a princess's return. Her heart no longer wavers, and the spear in her hand becomes the power to pierce through weakness.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Grant a <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield and $1 Down Points to all allies. Inflict all foes with <link\\=\"s|143\"><u>Taunt</u></link>, decrease Motoha's DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>. Lasts until the start of Motoha's next turn. \\nAt the start of next turn, automatically activate [Thunder Thrust]'s damage, each time Motoha takes skill damage during this effect, increase that [Thunder Thrust]'s <link\\=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $4. Motoha gains <link\\=\"s|289\"><u>[Shadow]</u></link>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The great golden sun rises slowly. Before this unsetting sun, all malice finds nowhere to hide.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Immediately enter [Resolute Maiden] state. Lasts for $1 turns.\\nDeal Elec damage to $2 targets equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK (can select the same target), if skill targets have <link\\=\"s|293\"><u>[Flashover]</u></link>, increase Skill Damage to $4 of its normal damage.\\n[Resolute Maiden]: When activating a HIGHLIGHT, increase skill multiplier by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Every flicker of lightning is a herald of death, unapologetically consuming everything around it, leaving behind only swift destruction and surging currents.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: [Twilight Radiance]\\nUse condition: When Motoha has at least $1 <link\\=\"s|289\"><u>[Light]/[Shadow]</u></link> stacks.\\nSelect $2 foes (can select the same target) and use [Spear of Light] and [Spear of Shadow] on them.\\n[Spear of Light]: Deal Elec damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK.\\n[Spear of Shadow]: Deal <link\\=\"s|294\"><u>Fixed Damage</u></link> equal of $4 of [Spear of Light]'s damage. Then ignore all affinities and decrease Down Points by $5.\\nIf [Spear of Light] and [Spear of Shadow] hit $6 foes, increase Skill Damage to $7 of its normal damage. If they hit the same foe, increase this skill's Crit DMG by $8.\\nSpend $9 <link\\=\"s|289\"><u>[Light]/[Shadow]</u></link> stacks ([Light] will be spent first), for each [Light] stack spent, increase [Spear of Light]'s ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$10</color>. For each [Shadow] stack spent, grant a <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> Shield to all allies. Lasts for $12 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Elec damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "At the start of battle, {{A}} enters <link\\=\"s|290\"><u>[Resolute Maiden]</u></link> state. Lasts for $1 turns. When <link\\=\"s|290\"><u>[Resolute Maiden]</u></link> is active, increase Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>.": "",
  "At the start of battle, {{A}} enters <link\\=\"s|290\"><u>[Resolute Maiden]</u></link> state. Lasts for $1 turns. When <link\\=\"s|290\"><u>[Resolute Maiden]</u></link> is active, increase Pierce by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color>.": "",
