  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Light]/[Shadow]</color>": "",
  "{{A}}'s special resource. At the start of {{A}}'s turn, gain $1 [Light] stack, gain [Light]/[Shadow] stack when activating specific {{B}} skills. Stacks up to $2 times. When activating HIGHLIGHT [Twilight Radiance], spend $3 [Light]/[Shadow] stacks, then activate bonus effects based on [Light]/[Shadow] stack spent. For each [Light] stack spent, increase [Spear of Light]'s ATK. For each [Shadow] stack spent, grant a Shield to all allies.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Flowing Light]</color>": "",
  "{{A}}'s special resource. When spending [Flowing Light] from [Twilight Radiance], the effects of [Light] and [Shadow] will both activate.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>Fixed Damage</color>": "",
  "The damage is a fixed value and is not affected by any damage-boosting effects (such as DMG Bonus, ATK Bonus, Crit Rate, etc).": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Resolute Maiden]</color>": "",
  "{{A}}'s special state. After entering [Resolute Maiden], when activating a HIGHLIGHT, increase skill multiplier.": "",
  "<color\\=#66ccff>[Flashover]</color>": "",
  "{{A}} can inflict this debuff when directly using [Thunder Thrust], increase foes' DMG Taken.": "",
