  "{{A}}'s special HIGHLIGHT, it does not deplete HIGHLIGHT Energy, does not have a cooldown, can be stored multiple times, and can activate critical hits. Can be activated when Motoha has at least $1 [Light]/[Shadow] stacks.": "",
  "Piercing Light": "",
  "{{A}} has a special HIGHLIGHT [Twilight Radiance], it does not deplete HIGHLIGHT Energy, does not have a cooldown, can be stored multiple times, and can activate critical hits.\\nAt the start of {{A}}'s turn, gain $1 [Light] stack, gain [Light]/[Shadow] stack when activating specific {{B}} skills. Stacks up to $2 times. When activating [Twilight Radiance], spend $3 [Light]/[Shadow] stacks, then activate bonus effects based on [Light]/[Shadow] stack spent ([Light] will be spent first).": "",
  "Solar Procession": "",
  "When {{A}} gains <link\\=\"s|289\"><u>[Light]/[Shadow]</u></link>, upgrade it to [Flowing Light]. When spending <link\\=\"s|288\"><u>[Flowing Light]</u></link> from [Twilight Radiance], the effects of <link\\=\"s|289\"><u>[Light] and [Shadow]</u></link> will both activate.\\nWhen {{A}} enters <link\\=\"s|290\"><u>[Resolute Maiden]</u></link> state, immediately gain 1 [Flowing Light] stack. When <link\\=\"s|290\"><u>[Resolute Maiden]</u></link> is active, increase Crit Rate by $1.": "",
