  "Deal Gun damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Increase the next [Wild Barrage]'s Skill Damage by $2. Aigis gains $3 [Powerful Rounds]. Lasts for $4 turns. Stacks up to $5 times.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The moment the command is given, a torrential rain of bullet shoots forth, striking the enemies' vitals in the same instant, dealing Gun damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Aigis gains $1 {{A}} Energy, then immediately use [Activate Orgia Mode], this does not spend {{A}} Energy. Aigis gains $2 [Explosive Rounds], change this skill to [Suppressive Onslaught].\\nIncrease Aigis's ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> and Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color>. Lasts for $5 turns.\\n[Suppressive Onslaught]:\\nUse condition: When [Orgia Mode] is active\\nDeal Gun damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> of ATK. Spend all {{A}} Energy (including saved {{A}} Energy), for every $7 {{A}} Energy spent, increase the skill multiplier by <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color>.\\nSpend all [Powerful Rounds] and [Explosive Rounds]. For every $9 [Powerful Rounds] spent, increase Skill Damage by $10. For every $11 [Explosive Rounds] spent, increase Aigis's Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$12</color>.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The iron heart pounds for the coming battle, senses pushed to their extreme. It is as if time has pressed the fast-forward button for this robotic girl...</color></size></b>": "",
  "Activate Orgia Mode: Use condition: When Aigis has $1 Theurgy Energy\\nDeal Gun damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, this damage can deal critical hits. Aigis enters [Orgia Mode].\\n[Orgia Mode]: Aigis becomes uncontrollable, after every $3 allies' non-Extra Action actions, alternate between using [Wild Barrage] or [Flash Strike]. When [Orgia Mode] is active, Aigis gains Null Down and Null Mental/Control Ailments, all skills count as {{B}} skills, and can deal critical hits.\\nWhen [Orgia Mode] is active, at the start of Aigis's turn, if she can use [Suppressive Onslaught], automatically use [Suppressive Onslaught], end Aigis's turn, and exit [Orgia Mode]. If Aigis cannot use [Suppressive Onslaught], automatically use [Wild Barrage], end Aigis's turn, and exit [Orgia Mode]. Revert [Suppressive Onslaught] to [Gear Boost].\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nAssist Skill: Assist Skill: Deal Gun damage to all foes equal to $4 of ATK. Permanently increase all S.E.E.S. members' ATK by $5.": "",
